"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TyrannicalRabbit</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The American woke ideas coming to Europe stuff they are saying is a dead giveaway.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, since you're entirely out of the loop, let me give you a window on what europeans are about on that matter.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/world-europe-59584125\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/branded_news/131B8/production/_122046287_franceliberty.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/world-europe-59584125\" target=\"_blank\"> France resists US challenge to its values </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/world-europe-59584125\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.bbc.com/news/world-europe-59584125 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> The government is fighting back at what it sees as imported cultural ideas from the UK and US. </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://metahodos.fr/2021/09/22/le-wokisme-une-fievre-americaine-qui-atteint-leurope/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://metahodos.fr/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/anti-racism_demonstration_copenhagen_denmark_2015_04.jpg?w=1024\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://metahodos.fr/2021/09/22/le-wokisme-une-fievre-americaine-qui-atteint-leurope/\" target=\"_blank\"> &laquo;Le &ldquo;wokisme&rdquo;, une fi&egrave;vre am&eacute;ricaine qui atteint l&rsquo;Europe&raquo; </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://metahodos.fr/2021/09/22/le-wokisme-une-fievre-americaine-qui-atteint-leurope/\" target=\"_blank\"> https://metahodos.fr/2021/09/22/le-wokisme-une-fievre-americaine-qui-atteint-leurope/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> CONVERSATIONS TOCQUEVILLE, SUITE Dans le prolongement de notre publication d&rsquo;hier : L&rsquo;avenir des d&eacute;mocraties occidentales : &laquo;Comment transformer les maux de l&rsquo;Occident en projets &hellip; </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://edition.cnn.com/2022/01/07/europe/war-on-woke-europe-cmd-intl/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://media.cnn.com/api/v1/images/stellar/prod/211217161134-war-on-woke-europe-cmd-intl-file-061119.jpg?c=16x9&amp;q=w_800,c_fill\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://edition.cnn.com/2022/01/07/europe/war-on-woke-europe-cmd-intl/index.html\" target=\"_blank\"> Analysis: The &lsquo;anti-woke&rsquo; crusade has come to Europe. Its effects could be chilling | CNN </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://edition.cnn.com/2022/01/07/europe/war-on-woke-europe-cmd-intl/index.html\" target=\"_blank\"> https://edition.cnn.com/2022/01/07/europe/war-on-woke-europe-cmd-intl/index.html </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> If 2020 renewed calls for racial equality as Black Lives Matter protests exploded throughout Europe, 2021 brought in the backlash as parts of the political establishment waged a so-called &ldquo;war against woke.&rdquo; </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.newsweek.com/macron-france-reject-american-woke-culture-thats-racializing-their-country-1634706\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.newsweek.com/macron-fran...ountry-1634706</a><br /> <br /> But suuuuuure, tell me it's just talking points","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24043-nyremne","name":"Nyremne","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"414"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-23T19:56:52-07:00","id":1521306,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1520736-what-do-you-think-they-are-going-to-do-for-v6?p=1521301#post1521301\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cEQEPGDbU4U\" data-code=\"cEQEPGDbU4U\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/cEQEPGDbU4U/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Your delusion is strong. Nothing I say is buzzword.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24043-nyremne","name":"Nyremne","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"414"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-23T20:41:49-07:00","id":1521307,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyremne</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1520736-what-do-you-think-they-are-going-to-do-for-v6?p=1521280#post1521280\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The idea that people calling out woke are racist bigoted and so on is a pretty empty accusation. &quot;anti wokism&quot; sentiment is pretty much shared across the populations that have been exposed to this american idea. You find this opposition as much in the american right wing as in the french socialists.<br /> <br /> Woke is pejorative because people calling themselves wokes show themselves as amongs the most bigoted, racists, authoritarian and hateful people in modern western culture.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thing is, nobody really calls themselves &quot;woke.&quot; About the only people that do are some African-Americans, who created the term back a century ago. Rather &quot;Woke&quot; has become a label that conservatives throw on everything they don't like from, yes, black people, but also gay people, transgender people, feminists, young people, etc. It's also used as a word to describe liberal aspects of American culture (mainly in terms of racial, feminist and LBTQ+ acceptance) that people in other countries don't like. Thing is if you ask conservatives or people in other countries who claim to hate woke what woke means, they can't do it because they just use it as a catch all term for everything they don't like. <br /> <br /> It's like CRT (Critical Race Theory). Conservatives scream about it, how dangerous it is, how it's being taught in elementary schools, but it's all bullshit. It's something that's taught in law school, and most colleges, let alone high school or elementary schools couldn't even begin to teach it. But they just label anything dealing with race (even discussing things like the African Slave Trade or the Civil Rights Movement) as CRT. But again, if you ask conservatives to define CRT they can't, because they're just using it as a catch all word to describe everything about race they don't like. <br /> <br /> In both cases it's just white conservatives forming strawmen out of words created by black people so that they can scream about how dangerous black people are. That's all this is. At the core it's just white racists going after black people, and you see white racists in Europe and other countries getting in on the bandwagon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-23T21:04:27-07:00","id":1521311,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Matt Corleone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1520736-what-do-you-think-they-are-going-to-do-for-v6?p=1521255#post1521255\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Punk sucks and it was never good. The music sucks and the subculture sucks. And I'm not talking about pop punk at all either, I'm talking about real punk acts like The Clash, Crass, Rage Against The Machine, The Circle Jerks, The Germs, Bikini Kill, The Dead Kennedys, etc. Punk fucking sucks.<br /> <br /> I've dealt with the punk subculture before. A lot of the people who abused me in the past were often either part of the punk subculture or were supportive of it.<br /> <br /> Seriously, in my experience, punk is just conformity that's masquerading as rebellious non-conformity. There, I fucking said it.</div> </div> </div> </div>O-kay. I'm sorry to hear you had such hardship and pain handed to you by the subculture.<br /> <br /> That said, I would being doing a disservice to people who have been there for me if I didn't say that I've been very lucky to have the punk community be a real support for me in my transition, and I know punk music helped me have the headspace to accept being trans. We definitely need a new punk(-adjacent), but what came before is not useless for everyone. <hr />As for the rest of this conversation:<br /> <br /> Oh look at that, it's turned into a &quot;Woke is/n't ruining pop culture&quot; thread again. While I'm quite willing to take a side (progressive politics is necessary counter-culture, sorry), maybe we want to take a break from that and turn to something else, like &quot;What should a 90's counter-cultural game space like World look like in the 2020's?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-23T22:19:14-07:00","id":1521314,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1520736-what-do-you-think-they-are-going-to-do-for-v6?p=1521311#post1521311\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">O-kay. I'm sorry to hear you had such hardship and pain handed to you by the subculture.<br /> <br /> That said, I would being doing a disservice to people who have been there for me if I didn't say that I've been very lucky to have the punk community be a real support for me in my transition, and I know punk music helped me have the headspace to accept being trans. We definitely need a new punk(-adjacent), but what came before is not useless for everyone.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm genuinely glad your experiences with punk were a lot better than mine but unfortunately I cannot give the punk scene the benefit of the doubt ever again due to both my experiences and the experiences of a few others close to me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm just a trans guy and gaming fan, unabashed hedonist and unusually upbeat nihilist, fairly laid back. He/Him.<br /> <br /> If everything is political, then nothing is!","edited":{"userid":25920,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25920-matt-corleone","user":"Matt Corleone","date":". 08-24-2023, 01:21 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25920-matt-corleone","name":"Matt Corleone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25920_8.webp","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"393"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-24T10:47:36-07:00","id":1521339,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TyrannicalRabbit</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The American woke ideas coming to Europe stuff they are saying is a dead giveaway.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm guessing that claims of speaking for &quot;the west&quot; are also ticking a box.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-24T12:42:26-07:00","id":1521344,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyremne</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1520736-what-do-you-think-they-are-going-to-do-for-v6?p=1521305#post1521305\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well, since you're entirely out of the loop, let me give you a window on what europeans are about on that matter.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/world-europe-59584125\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/branded_news/131B8/production/_122046287_franceliberty.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/world-europe-59584125\" target=\"_blank\"> France resists US challenge to its values </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/world-europe-59584125\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.bbc.com/news/world-europe-59584125 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> The government is fighting back at what it sees as imported cultural ideas from the UK and US. </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://metahodos.fr/2021/09/22/le-wokisme-une-fievre-americaine-qui-atteint-leurope/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://metahodos.fr/wp-content/uploads/2021/09/anti-racism_demonstration_copenhagen_denmark_2015_04.jpg?w=1024\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://metahodos.fr/2021/09/22/le-wokisme-une-fievre-americaine-qui-atteint-leurope/\" target=\"_blank\"> &laquo;Le &ldquo;wokisme&rdquo;, une fi&egrave;vre am&eacute;ricaine qui atteint l&rsquo;Europe&raquo; </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://metahodos.fr/2021/09/22/le-wokisme-une-fievre-americaine-qui-atteint-leurope/\" target=\"_blank\"> https://metahodos.fr/2021/09/22/le-wokisme-une-fievre-americaine-qui-atteint-leurope/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> CONVERSATIONS TOCQUEVILLE, SUITE Dans le prolongement de notre publication d&rsquo;hier : L&rsquo;avenir des d&eacute;mocraties occidentales : &laquo;Comment transformer les maux de l&rsquo;Occident en projets &hellip; </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://edition.cnn.com/2022/01/07/europe/war-on-woke-europe-cmd-intl/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://media.cnn.com/api/v1/images/stellar/prod/211217161134-war-on-woke-europe-cmd-intl-file-061119.jpg?c=16x9&amp;q=w_800,c_fill\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://edition.cnn.com/2022/01/07/europe/war-on-woke-europe-cmd-intl/index.html\" target=\"_blank\"> Analysis: The &lsquo;anti-woke&rsquo; crusade has come to Europe. Its effects could be chilling | CNN </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://edition.cnn.com/2022/01/07/europe/war-on-woke-europe-cmd-intl/index.html\" target=\"_blank\"> https://edition.cnn.com/2022/01/07/europe/war-on-woke-europe-cmd-intl/index.html </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> If 2020 renewed calls for racial equality as Black Lives Matter protests exploded throughout Europe, 2021 brought in the backlash as parts of the political establishment waged a so-called &ldquo;war against woke.&rdquo; </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.newsweek.com/macron-france-reject-american-woke-culture-thats-racializing-their-country-1634706\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.newsweek.com/macron-fran...ountry-1634706</a><br /> <br /> But suuuuuure, tell me it's just talking points</div> </div> </div> </div>Interesting articles that you have posted and quite informative.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar