ate":"2023-08-27T02:54:44-07:00","id":1521459,"title":"","content":"We've got a thing in our local games we're we pick out a motif song for pcs. For example the former salubri antitribu now turned reborn warrior salubri went with 2pac &quot;that's just the way it is&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-28T05:18:39-07:00","id":1521501,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TyrannicalRabbit</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Doing a stellar job telling another EU person that their repeated posting of racist right wing European ranting is totally not about being a racist and all around bigot throwing out the latest in buzzwords the very people using it as a pejorative don't even really understand.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, when you are ignorant of a subject, of course someone will have to explain it to you.<br /> <br /> You're out of touch if you think describing a concern toward a divisive identitarian ideology means being racist, bigotted or right wing.<br /> <br /> No matter how much you stick your fingers in your ears, the term of wokism as pejorative is used even in the EU parliament and by national leaders regardless of political position (and if you're going to posit that Macron is right wing, I'll be sure that you're a troll).<br /> <br /> <br /> Don't dare to speak about buzzwords when your use of terms like &quot;racist&quot; and &quot;bigot&quot; are nothing but that.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TyrannicalRabbit</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am reminded of an older conversation about toxic portions of the WoD fanbase getting up in arms about so called wokeness, you're about 30 plus years too late to complain.<br /> <br /> Luckily, it isn't a debate or about pop culture.</div> </div> </div> </div>People aren't toxic because they oppose an ideology. You really need to cue using words you don't understand<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TyrannicalRabbit</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;I'm like totally posting these racist articles that include pictures of Nigel Farage and talking about the idea of western civilization because Twitter people are like hypocritical or some such! Something something economic anxiety!&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Nuwolf should have been louder when they said certain nasty types shouldn't be in the fanbase.<br /> <br /> \u200b</div> </div> </div> </div>Thete's litterally nothing racist in any of the article I posted.<br /> <br /> But that comment explain your incoherent rants. You don't understand what the term racism means. <br /> <br /> And frankly, I'm the nasty type that shouldn't be in tbe fanbase? Being critical of an american ideology is equivalent to being a nazi?<br /> <br /> Touch some grass, and eventually get some help. You're the one being toxic here.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24043-nyremne","name":"Nyremne","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"414"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-28T05:25:15-07:00","id":1521502,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1520736-what-do-you-think-they-are-going-to-do-for-v6?p=1521307#post1521307\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Thing is, nobody really calls themselves &quot;woke.&quot; About the only people that do are some African-Americans, who created the term back a century ago. Rather &quot;Woke&quot; has become a label that conservatives throw on everything they don't like from, yes, black people, but also gay people, transgender people, feminists, young people, etc. It's also used as a word to describe liberal aspects of American culture (mainly in terms of racial, feminist and LBTQ+ acceptance) that people in other countries don't like. Thing is if you ask conservatives or people in other countries who claim to hate woke what woke means, they can't do it because they just use it as a catch all term for everything they don't like.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>That's simply not true. The term is being used to define people following a specific ideological framework, not individuals.<br /> <br /> You clearly never asked someone what they meant by woke, because it's extremely easy<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1520736-what-do-you-think-they-are-going-to-do-for-v6?p=1521307#post1521307\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's like CRT (Critical Race Theory). Conservatives scream about it, how dangerous it is, how it's being taught in elementary schools, but it's all bullshit. It's something that's taught in law school, and most colleges, let alone high school or elementary schools couldn't even begin to teach it. But they just label anything dealing with race (even discussing things like the African Slave Trade or the Civil Rights Movement) as CRT. But again, if you ask conservatives to define CRT they can't, because they're just using it as a catch all word to describe everything about race they don't like.<br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div>I'm afraid you're a bit out of date on that. For a start, CRT is teached in k-12.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://kappanonline.org/crt-in-k-12-choi/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://kappanonline.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/PDK_104_6_backtalk-1.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://kappanonline.org/crt-in-k-12-choi/\" target=\"_blank\"> The controversy of teaching CRT in K-12 - Kappan Online </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://kappanonline.org/crt-in-k-12-choi/\" target=\"_blank\"> https://kappanonline.org/crt-in-k-12-choi/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> 1 (2) During a trip to Colorado, my family and I visited an underground gold mine. On the hourlong tour, we descended 1,000 feet into the earth and got a glimpse of what it is to live as a miner &mdash; hearing the sickening repetition of banging, digging, and scraping while suffocating underground with no [&hellip;] </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.theedadvocate.org/critical-race-theory-in-k-12-education-examples/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://www.theedadvocate.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/The-Edvocate-220x90b-Without-Subscript.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.theedadvocate.org/critical-race-theory-in-k-12-education-examples/\" target=\"_blank\"> Page not found - The Edvocate </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.theedadvocate.org/critical-race-theory-in-k-12-education-examples/\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.theedadvocate.org/critical-race-theory-in-k-12-education-examples/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> <br /> It's also not just a label for everything speaking about race or slavery. <br /> CRT is an hypothesis with specific axioms and beliefs, which are everything the american right wing decry.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1520736-what-do-you-think-they-are-going-to-do-for-v6?p=1521307#post1521307\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In both cases it's just white conservatives forming strawmen out of words created by black people so that they can scream about how dangerous black people are. That's all this is. At the core it's just white racists going after black people, and you see white racists in Europe and other countries getting in on the bandwagon.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> \u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b<br /> that's entirely false. Ironically, most people accused of being woke by the right are white liberals. <br /> And it's not &quot;whites against woke&quot;. People of all races oppose it. <br /> <br /> If your only response to that criticism is to imagine that it's all racist white people, you're either terribly ignorant or terribly dishonest<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24043-nyremne","name":"Nyremne","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"414"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-28T06:54:53-07:00","id":1521507,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#e74c3c\"><b>Nyremne, leave the thread please. </b></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-28T09:56:14-07:00","id":1521514,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1520736-what-do-you-think-they-are-going-to-do-for-v6?p=1521507#post1521507\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:#e74c3c\"><b>Nyremne, leave the thread please. </b></span></div> </div> </div> </div>For what reason?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24043-nyremne","name":"Nyremne","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"414"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-28T13:25:02-07:00","id":1521528,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#e74c3c\"><b>Your recent posts have been combative and off-topic, whatever discussion is left to have in this thread will be healthier without you in it. </b></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-28T15:01:20-07:00","id":1521539,"title":"","content":"Do you think it will be more likely that our game will go full digital and physical sourcebooks will become a thing of the past?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-28T17:16:05-07:00","id":1521559,"title":"","content":"As I said earlier, I don't think physical books are going to fully disappear. I do think they' become more expensive and demand will drop for that and other reasons. While it might not happen by the time a theoretical V6 lands, but at some point digital is going to overtake physical as the &quot;default&quot; and physical will become the side product.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-28T18:48:55-07:00","id":1521564,"title":"","content":"I'll just go on a bit of a rant about woke as perceived by a Brazilian that saw a quick escalate of the extreme right following the debacle of Harvard Analytics. In one hand, the fall of USSR gane way to the ascension of neoliberalism and whole new framework to the world. Here in Latin America, with the dictatorships financed by CIA we also lost all the extreme left and a sensible part of the thinkers of the centrist left. But the erasure of the left, together with the control of media worthy of the NWO, just shifted the world massively. The 2008, 2016 and 2020 economic collapses opened space to the color revolutions and a new wave of extreme right. Only recently the left is reorganizing and expanding, and definitely os not on the great companies.<br /> Well, now to V5. This shift provoked a change on the spirit of the game. You wouldn't go after stabilished powers, Goddess gracious, no. And you wouldn't ever be a part of the new powers, so the game is all on street level. Of course, let's have some performatism, but no real criticism, because Cher forbids something so in the face. And you'll be a killer, so both the possibilities of going full ethical or too comfortable are clipped. Lasombras are a pale shadow of their formal glory, the Sabbath is in ruins, the Anarchs are little more than street gangs, and the Camarilla are televangelists and different flavors of religious fanatics (like part of Sabbath used to be, but without the aplomb, as I see).<br /> In a V6, I would expect functional elders and better growing possibilities, bringing back the clan powers, and a better tinkered Hungry. And bring back the shameless night predators.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27825-mrdrika","name":"MrDrika","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27825_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"64"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-29T17:10:07-07:00","id":1521629,"title":"","content":"Maybe they will have some fan submission contests at some point to bring in fresh eyes so to speak and offer improvements in game play, settings and such.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-01T19:17:36-07:00","id":1521849,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Matt Corleone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1520736-what-do-you-think-they-are-going-to-do-for-v6?p=1521255#post1521255\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Punk sucks and it was never good. The music sucks and the subculture sucks. And I'm not talking about pop punk at all either, I'm talking about real punk acts like The Clash, Crass, Rage Against The Machine, The Circle Jerks, The Germs, Bikini Kill, The Dead Kennedys, etc. Punk fucking sucks.<br /> <br /> I've dealt with the punk subculture before. A lot of the people who abused me in the past were often either part of the punk subculture or were supportive of it.<br /> <br /> Seriously, in my experience, punk is just conformity that's masquerading as rebellious non-conformity. There, I fucking said it.</div> </div> </div> </div>You realize that is the most punk thing that you could say about the punk movement, right?<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> But yes, my biggest experience with the punk movement since I caught the tail end of it was how much everything punk was sell out shit or crap to begin with.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MrDrika</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1520736-what-do-you-think-they-are-going-to-do-for-v6?p=1521564#post1521564\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'll just go on a bit of a rant about woke as perceived by a Brazilian that saw a quick escalate of the extreme right following the debacle of Harvard Analytics. In one hand, the fall of USSR gane way to the ascension of neoliberalism and whole new framework to the world. Here in Latin America, with the dictatorships financed by CIA we also lost all the extreme left and a sensible part of the thinkers of the centrist left. But the erasure of the left, together with the control of media worthy of the NWO, just shifted the world massively. The 2008, 2016 and 2020 economic collapses opened space to the color revolutions and a new wave of extreme right. Only recently the left is reorganizing and expanding, and definitely os not on the great companies.<br /> Well, now to V5. This shift provoked a change on the spirit of the game. You wouldn't go after stabilished powers, Goddess gracious, no. And you wouldn't ever be a part of the new powers, so the game is all on street level. Of course, let's have some performatism, but no real criticism, because Cher forbids something so in the face. And you'll be a killer, so both the possibilities of going full ethical or too comfortable are clipped. Lasombras are a pale shadow of their formal glory, the Sabbath is in ruins, the Anarchs are little more than street gangs, and the Camarilla are televangelists and different flavors of religious fanatics (like part of Sabbath used to be, but without the aplomb, as I see).<br /> In a V6, I would expect functional elders and better growing possibilities, bringing back the clan powers, and a better tinkered Hungry. And bring back the shameless night predators.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200b<br /> <br /> Eh, the Revolution will always be sold to the masses via t-shirts, posters, and music. Which is a way of saying that the big corporations aren't afraid to make fun of the big corporations and tell the masses to Eat the Rich. Aerosmith made a song about it that sold millions after all. So, I totally believe the World of Darkness should have every bit the anger and &quot;fuck the man&quot; mentality it deserves as that's what makes the books and games relevant. Sure, it won't mean anything in the long run any more than the V for Vendetta movie but it will be artistically relevant as well as appeal to the masses, IMHO.<br /> <br /> The big problem with the game is the fact that there really is a &quot;crazy hype police&quot; to go along with the people who will attack the game for being woke or progressive. The people who went after Matthew Dawkins or saw Nazi attitudes or Alt-Right code in the games. It's a horror game and when a story has a Ventrue who likes &quot;young children&quot; as a horror element, that's not an ENDORSEMENT of playing a pedophile.<br /> <br /> Of course there's Neo-Nazi Brujah. There's probably actual Nazi Brujah. KKK Brujah and Neo-Confederates. There's also Clan members who will hunt these assholes down.<br /> <br /> But trying to tell the public that, &quot;Yes, you can play a monster and depicting monsters without endorsing their viewpoints&quot; is somewhat hard.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 09-01-2023, 10:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-02T07:45:19-07:00","id":1521873,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MrDrika</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1520736-what-do-you-think-they-are-going-to-do-for-v6?p=1521564#post1521564\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'll just go on a bit of a rant about woke as perceived by a Brazilian that saw a quick escalate of the extreme right following the debacle of Harvard Analytics. In one hand, the fall of USSR gane way to the ascension of neoliberalism and whole new framework to the world. Here in Latin America, with the dictatorships financed by CIA we also lost all the extreme left and a sensible part of the thinkers of the centrist left. But the erasure of the left, together with the control of media worthy of the NWO, just shifted the world massively. The 2008, 2016 and 2020 economic collapses opened space to the color revolutions and a new wave of extreme right. Only recently the left is reorganizing and expanding, and definitely os not on the great companies.<br /> Well, now to V5. This shift provoked a change on the spirit of the game. You wouldn't go after stabilished powers, Goddess gracious, no. And you wouldn't ever be a part of the new powers, so the game is all on street level. Of course, let's have some performatism, but no real criticism, because Cher forbids something so in the face. And you'll be a killer, so both the possibilities of going full ethical or too comfortable are clipped. Lasombras are a pale shadow of their formal glory, the Sabbath is in ruins, the Anarchs are little more than street gangs, and the Camarilla are televangelists and different flavors of religious fanatics (like part of Sabbath used to be, but without the aplomb, as I see).<br /> In a V6, I would expect functional elders and better growing possibilities, bringing back the clan powers, and a better tinkered Hungry. And bring back the shameless night predators.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sorry, I think there is a bit of disconnect in how you are evaluating V5.<br /> <br /> I can't see how functional elders are necessary to bring the game back to the roots of criticism and going after stabilised powers. <br /> <br /> If anything, V5 is usually criticised because it's too eager to paint the Camarilla as evil, whereas the default Revised game was one of people trying to climb the corporate-feudal ladder of the Ivory Tower. <br /> <br /> All of the Wod5e books are quite loudly proclaiming the evils of capitalism, fascism and systemic oppression. Which is hardly surprising, considering the very outspoken politics of both Martin Ericsson and Justin Achilli, as well as of the various freelancers involved (from Matthew Dawkins and his team during the Modiphius / OPP tenure, to Khaldoun Kheklil nowadays). <br /> <br /> The difference in tone I see with the 20th editions is more in the fact that OPP tried to present the various Institutions as having increasingly progressive groups and factions, which have surpassed or are surpassing old prejudices, whereas in Wod5e there is much more pronounced pessimism towards the Powers that Be, and progressives are both &quot;in the resistance&quot; and facing their own contradictions. <br /> <br /> It's a difference that is bound to cause controversy - why should I have to face systemic oppression in a fantasy exercise of power? One could ask. Why should I paint a systematically oppressive world through rosier glassed? Another one could ask. Is the representation of evil something which enhances consciousness or that weakens resolve?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12590-manfr","name":"Manfr","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"449"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-02T09:14:54-07:00","id":1521883,"title":"","content":"The &quot;proclamations&quot; against various evils is kinda the problem. WoD5e generally takes the worst approach: it calls things out and then doesn't actually do anything about it (an in, as a game, playing it doesn't confront these topics in any sort of useful way). Saying fascism is evil, putting realistically evil fascists in your game, and then not having any way for the players to do anything significant about that is both unfulfilling and a stupid message if you think fascism is evil; because you're just saying there's nothing that can be done about it.<br /> <br /> The sidebar in W5 about how corporations can be good things for the exercise of collective power (even though corporations are inherently tools of capitalism and are always an ethical compromise to anti-capitalists), while the game denies Garou the ability to operate in groups larger than a small handful, and removing their whole network of human families to aid in large scale activism is the height of this sort of hypocrisy. Don't tell me capitalism is evil, but corporations can be moral goods for society, while non-corporate social collectives are powerless and useless because they are doomed to in-fighting.<br /> <br /> Also remember that OPP's tenure with the 20th Anniversary books was never something they had complete control over. Original WW set the tone of those as omnibus nostalgia collections that only gathered old material with some new polish. CCP didn't really want take the risks of any larger changes because they wanted consistency for their WoDMMO project. In the short period between the MMO getting canceled and the Paradox buyout (less than 2 years, though Rich had warning before hand which let him set up OPP before the official annoucement), OPP had already started making bigger change in the tone of the 20th books, and were going to start a proper new edition with the clear renewed interest in the WoD thanks to the 20th line. Then Paradox bought things and forced OPP to stop implementing changes and keep more old things that fans wanted to see changed, so they could get changed in WoD5 instead.<br /> <br /> OPP was also trying to differentiate between the WoD and CofD as more distinct games, with the CofD better positioned to be the one about &quot;street&quot; level games and a more pessimistic setting thanks to it's existing rule and lore, while WoD 20 was doing great with books that dealt with the grander scope the WoD reached.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-02T13:50:58-07:00","id":1521900,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Matt Corleone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1520736-what-do-you-think-they-are-going-to-do-for-v6?p=1521255#post1521255\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Punk sucks and it was never good. The music sucks and the subculture sucks. And I'm not talking about pop punk at all either, I'm talking about real punk acts like The Clash, Crass, Rage Against The Machine, The Circle Jerks, The Germs, Bikini Kill, The Dead Kennedys, etc. Punk fucking sucks.<br /> <br /> I've dealt with the punk subculture before. A lot of the people who abused me in the past were often either part of the punk subculture or were supportive of it.<br /> <br /> Seriously, in my experience, punk is just conformity that's masquerading as rebellious non-conformity. There, I fucking said it.</div> </div> </div> </div>You realize that is the most punk thing that you could say about the punk movement, right?<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> But yes, my biggest experience with the punk movement since I caught the tail end of it was how much everything punk was sell out shit or crap to begin with.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MrDrika</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1520736-what-do-you-think-they-are-going-to-do-for-v6?p=1521564#post1521564\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'll just go on a bit of a rant about woke as perceived by a Brazilian that saw a quick escalate of the extreme right following the debacle of Harvard Analytics. In one hand, the fall of USSR gane way to the ascension of neoliberalism and whole new framework to the world. Here in Latin America, with the dictatorships financed by CIA we also lost all the extreme left and a sensible part of the thinkers of the centrist left. But the erasure of the left, together with the control of media worthy of the NWO, just shifted the world massively. The 2008, 2016 and 2020 economic collapses opened space to the color revolutions and a new wave of extreme right. Only recently the left is reorganizing and expanding, and definitely os not on the great companies.<br /> Well, now to V5. This shift provoked a change on the spirit of the game. You wouldn't go after stabilished powers, Goddess gracious, no. And you wouldn't ever be a part of the new powers, so the game is all on street level. Of course, let's have some performatism, but no real criticism, because Cher forbids something so in the face. And you'll be a killer, so both the possibilities of going full ethical or too comfortable are clipped. Lasombras are a pale shadow of their formal glory, the Sabbath is in ruins, the Anarchs are little more than street gangs, and the Camarilla are televangelists and different flavors of religious fanatics (like part of Sabbath used to be, but without the aplomb, as I see).<br /> In a V6, I would expect functional elders and better growing possibilities, bringing back the clan powers, and a better tinkered Hungry. And bring back the shameless night predators.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200b<br /> <br /> Eh, the Revolution will always be sold to the masses via t-shirts, posters, and music. Which is a way of saying that the big corporations aren't afraid to make fun of the big corporations and tell the masses to Eat the Rich. Aerosmith made a song about it that sold millions after all. So, I totally believe the World of Darkness should have every bit the anger and &quot;fuck the man&quot; mentality it deserves as that's what makes the books and games relevant. Sure, it won't mean anything in the long run any more than the V for Vendetta movie but it will be artistically relevant as well as appeal to the masses, IMHO.<br /> <br /> The big problem with the game is the fact that there really is a &quot;crazy hype police&quot; to go along with the people who will attack the game for being woke or progressive. The people who went after Matthew Dawkins or saw Nazi attitudes or Alt-Right code in the games. It's a horror game and when a story has a Ventrue who likes &quot;young children&quot; as a horror element, that's not an ENDORSEMENT of playing a pedophile.<br /> <br /> Of course there's Neo-Nazi Brujah. There's probably actual Nazi Brujah. KKK Brujah and Neo-Confederates. There's also Clan members who will hunt these assholes down.<br /> <br /> But trying to tell the public that, &quot;Yes, you can play a monster and depicting monsters without endorsing their viewpoints&quot; is somewhat hard.\u200b","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-02T14:21:28-07:00","id":1521906,"title":"","content":"The problem is that playing creatures that are traditionally monsters in fantasy and myth, but as allegories to confront real world evils, isn't actually the same as just playing evil piece of shit monsters. The way the WoD has traditionally used folklore based monsters means subverting the narratives of why they're monsters in said stories. How you communicate this is essential. As a Beast: the Primordial fan, I can point you to tons of passage from the Beast core that utterly failed to accomplish this task.<br /> <br /> When it comes to games especially, there's a big difference between, &quot;yes, there are racist vampires,&quot; and, &quot;vampire society is cool with vampires being racists, and here are some sample racist vampires you might want to play.&quot;<br /> <br /> I'm really not sure why this remains controversial, or why people can't get what the problem with some of the way V5 talked about these things (let along how poorly W5 has done with these issues) and insist on reframing this as some over-reaction the concept of their being Alt-Right Brujah in the setting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-02T14:48:57-07:00","id":1521912,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1520736-what-do-you-think-they-are-going-to-do-for-v6?p=1521906#post1521906\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> When it comes to games especially, there's a big difference between, &quot;yes, there are racist vampires,&quot; and, &quot;vampire society is cool with vampires being racists, and here are some sample racist vampires you might want to play.&quot;<br /> <br /> .</div> </div> </div> </div>Clanbook Brujah Revised literally had a Confederation apologist as a character template, and the &quot;Nazi Brujah&quot; Line has been there since 1st edition corebook.<br /> <br /> Why should vampire society not be cool with racist Vampires, if they are literally cool with every kind of horrible things? Vampires are DEFINITELY not better than humans.<br /> <br /> And, in any case, the fact that original demo characters werr explicitly called out as horrible people who deserved to fall (it was literally written in the adventure brief) didn't stop the rumors mill about alt rightism and dog whistling by WW.<br /> <br /> I mean, there were lot of posters arguing against racist stereotypes about Mexico in the H5 book, and the actual NPCs and lore about Mexico were written by a Mexican author. Did someone notice?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12590,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12590-manfr","user":"Manfr","date":". 09-02-2023, 05:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12590-manfr","name":"Manfr","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"449"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-02T14:51:28-07:00","id":1521913,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1520736-what-do-you-think-they-are-going-to-do-for-v6?p=1521906#post1521906\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The problem is that playing creatures that are traditionally monsters in fantasy and myth, but as allegories to confront real world evils, isn't actually the same as just playing evil piece of shit monsters. The way the WoD has traditionally used folklore based monsters means subverting the narratives of why they're monsters in said stories. How you communicate this is essential. As a Beast: the Primordial fan, I can point you to tons of passage from the Beast core that utterly failed to accomplish this task.<br /> <br /> <b>When it comes to games especially, there's a big difference between, &quot;yes, there are racist vampires,&quot; and, &quot;vampire society is cool with vampires being racists, and here are some sample racist vampires you might want to play.&quot;</b><br /> <br /> I'm really not sure why this remains controversial, or why people can't get what the problem with some of the way V5 talked about these things (let along how poorly W5 has done with these issues) and insist on reframing this as some over-reaction the concept of their being Alt-Right Brujah in the setting.</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean, that is actually a big ??? because &quot;Vampire society is also okay with SLAVERY and MURDER&quot; because the point is that vampire society is <i>evil.</i><br /> <br /> It's a punk game and you are in a society where the rich pale bastards are keeping the poor plucky vampires down.<br /> <br /> But like Cyberpunk 2077, some of the protagonists (Corpos) don't want to save the world. They want to rule it.<br /> <br /> Which is again, the fact that vampire PCs are not meant to be HEROES and depiction of corruption is not endorsement of it. You can play the monster in the game and that's FINE.<br /> <br /> It's just pretend.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 09-02-2023, 05:54 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-02T14:52:03-07:00","id":1521914,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1520736-what-do-you-think-they-are-going-to-do-for-v6?p=1521906#post1521906\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The problem is that playing creatures that are traditionally monsters in fantasy and myth, but as allegories to confront real world evils, isn't actually the same as just playing evil piece of shit monsters. The way the WoD has traditionally used folklore based monsters means subverting the narratives of why they're monsters in said stories. How you communicate this is essential. As a Beast: the Primordial fan, I can point you to tons of passage from the Beast core that utterly failed to accomplish this task.<br /> <br /> When it comes to games especially, there's a big difference between, &quot;yes, there are racist vampires,&quot; and, &quot;vampire society is cool with vampires being racists, and here are some sample racist vampires you might want to play.&quot;<br /> <br /> I'm really not sure why this remains controversial, or why people can't get what the problem with some of the way V5 talked about these things (let along how poorly W5 has done with these issues) and insist on reframing this as some over-reaction the concept of their being Alt-Right Brujah in the setting.</div> </div> </div> </div>Clanbook Brujah Revised literally had a Confederation apologist as a character template, and the &quot;Nazi Brujah&quot; Line has been there since 1st edition corebook. <br /> Why should vampire society not be cool with racist Vampires, if they are literally cool with every kind of horrible things? Vampires are DEFINITELY not better than humans.<br /> <br /> And, in any case, the fact that original demo characters werr explicitly called out as horrible people who deserved to fall (it was literally written in the adventure brief) didn't stop the rumors mill about alt rightism and dog whistling by WW.<br /> <br /> I mean, there were lot of posters arguing against racist stereotypes about Mexico in the H5 book, and the actual NPCs and lore about Mexico were written by a Mexican author. Did someone notice?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12590-manfr","name":"Manfr","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"449"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-02T14:57:39-07:00","id":1521917,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Manfr</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1520736-what-do-you-think-they-are-going-to-do-for-v6?p=1521914#post1521914\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Clanbook Brujah Revised literally had a Confederation apologist as a character template, and the &quot;Nazi Brujah&quot; Line has been there since 1st edition corebook.<br /> Why should vampire society not be cool with racist Vampires, if they are literally cool with every kind of horrible things? Vampires are DEFINITELY not better than humans.<br /> <br /> And, in any case, the fact that original demo characters werr explicitly called out as horrible people who deserved to fall (it was literally written in the adventure brief) didn't stop the rumors mill about alt rightism and dog whistling by WW.<br /> <br /> I mean, there were lot of posters arguing against racist stereotypes about Mexico in the H5 book, and the actual NPCs and lore about Mexico were written by a Mexican author. Did someone notice?</div> </div> </div> </div>There's a certain level of &quot;readers are fucking lemmings&quot; going on in writing with the assumption (that is a very Moral MajorityTM sort of attitude) that you can't enjoy something that isn't identical to their views or the views of the character represent their own.<br /> <br /> Which is silly.<br /> <br /> Vampire society is basically the same society as exists in Cyberpunk 2077 except instead of megacorporations like Arasaka, you have the Ventrue clan.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-02T15:16:00-07:00","id":1521921,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Manfr</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1520736-what-do-you-think-they-are-going-to-do-for-v6?p=1521914#post1521914\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Clanbook Brujah Revised...</div> </div> </div> </div>And? Old material having things that in retrospect were bad doesn't excuse continuing to do it. Should we go back to when the only Arabic coded Clan was a bunch of sociopath murderers because what else would vampires from the Middle East be good at? Or can we acknowledge that was bad, and move on (even if yes, some Middle Eastern vampires are going to be assassins as that job exists across the globe).<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Why should vampire society not be cool with racist Vampires... </div> </div> </div>Because this is a fictional construct and how the designer and writers frame it impacts its function.<br /> <br /> Though consider: vampire society is dominated by vampires that preexist our modern concept of race. Vampire society as presented scoffs at human sexism because, again, the Elders have plenty of women, and they know that sexism is just a way to anger and underestimate vampires just as capable as those that think physical features matter. Why would a vampire that saw the rise and fall of the Roman Empire (including Emperors of multiple ethnic backgrounds) tolerate some ancillae's mindless ramblings about how black vampires can't possibly be trusted with important positions like Primogen instead of seeing any vampire as the potential threat and asset that they are on the inside?<br /> <br /> How many cultures have Elders and Methuselahs seen rise and fall, all claim the same stupid human prejudices? &quot;We Greeks are clearly the best people, everyone else is a barbarian,&quot; unless Alexander's empire falls apart as his generals can never consolidate power and former barbarian-turned-civilization Romans take over? Then Romans do the same thing. And so, and so on. Human bigotry is a weakness for vampires to use to manipulate humans, not one that serves them in the slightest to hold on to.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> And, in any case, the fact that original demo characters werr explicitly called out as horrible people who deserved to fall (it was literally written in the adventure brief) didn't stop the rumors mill about alt rightism and dog whistling by WW. </div> </div> </div>And... this is still a deflection from it being a horrible idea for the one of the first V5 previews people got was that kind of scenario. One of the reasons why the rumor mill is so bad, is because nWW/Paradox have no sense about how to handle these topics with a wide audience.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I mean, there were lot of posters arguing against racist stereotypes about Mexico in the H5 book, and the actual NPCs and lore about Mexico were written by a Mexican author. Did someone notice? </div> </div> </div>Again, deflection.<br /> <br /> The problem people had, was that they hired a Mexican author to write a bunch of cool Mexican content, and then put that in a section where white American Hunters would have to hunt Mexicans.<br /> <br /> The section on the Philippines was much better received because they let the Filipino author work on the whole of it, including the hunters, and present a much better cultural expression by letting it be holistic and thus avoid that sort of issue.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-02T18:17:16-07:00","id":1521929,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1520736-what-do-you-think-they-are-going-to-do-for-v6?p=1521921#post1521921\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Though consider: vampire society is dominated by vampires that preexist our modern concept of race. Vampire society as presented scoffs at human sexism because, again, the Elders have plenty of women, and they know that sexism is just a way to anger and underestimate vampires just as capable as those that think physical features matter. Why would a vampire that saw the rise and fall of the Roman Empire (including Emperors of multiple ethnic backgrounds) tolerate some ancillae's mindless ramblings about how black vampires can't possibly be trusted with important positions like Primogen instead of seeing any vampire as the potential threat and asset that they are on the inside?<br /> <br /> How many cultures have Elders and Methuselahs seen rise and fall, all claim the same stupid human prejudices? &quot;We Greeks are clearly the best people, everyone else is a barbarian,&quot; unless Alexander's empire falls apart as his generals can never consolidate power and former barbarian-turned-civilization Romans take over? Then Romans do the same thing. And so, and so on. Human bigotry is a weakness for vampires to use to manipulate humans, not one that serves them in the slightest to hold on to.</div> </div> </div> </div>You have more faith in Vampires than I would. I have found myself reading their vibe is that they so desperatley tend to cling to where they came from and who they are that they became exaggerated parodies of that time and place. And while they do seek to be greater predators with more control and power, their blindspots tends to be the fact that they cannot let go of human follies.<br /> <br /> Now this may be a combined effort of noticing how certain patterns solidify for older people on one hand, and an emergent property of how sample characters have been written in Vampire, but I don't think the Elders are supposed to be these alien entities beyond human pettiness and small mindedness. The rarest and most dangerous of them probably are, but most of them won't be .","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-02T18:23:53-07:00","id":1521930,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Asmodai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1520736-what-do-you-think-they-are-going-to-do-for-v6?p=1521929#post1521929\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You have more faith in Vampires than I would. I have found myself reading their vibe is that they so desperatley tend to cling to where they came from and who they are that they became exaggerated parodies of that time and place. And while they do seek to be greater predators with more control and power, their blindspots tends to be the fact that they cannot let go of human follies.<br /> <br /> Now this may be a combined effort of noticing how certain patterns solidify for older people on one hand, and an emergent property of how sample characters have been written in Vampire, but I don't think the Elders are supposed to be these alien entities beyond human pettiness and small mindedness. The rarest and most dangerous of them probably are, but most of them won't be .</div> </div> </div> </div>I believe that scenario still has elders taking advantage of all the terrible shit, they're just not true believers in it, and you probably don't get to be a competitor if you're a true believer in it, because you can be conveniently made to fuck up fatally if you are. Anyone truly espousing a belief that actually believes in it in vampire society is probably the exception rather than the rule, simply on account of how readily they telegraph what their aims are and how to manipulate them, as well as how easily they can be disposed of afterward due to the enemies that they attract.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-02T19:35:08-07:00","id":1521938,"title":"","content":"Vampire society is absolutely okay with racism and sexism, insofar as it's okay with almost everything. The reality is that in the end, the rules are made and enforced by the most powerful vampires. If the Prince of some city hates Catholics and makes any Catholic vampire jump through so many hoops to stay in his city that most of them end up leaving, then until someone more powerful than him comes along and knocks him down, that's just how it is. The Camarilla doesn't send Justicars to go beat down vampires for being racist, or sexist, or hating on ethnicities or religions or anything else. As long as the Prince is making sure the Masquerade is upheld then the Camarilla probably won't bother with him.<br /> <br /> At the same time for the most part, older vampires have realized that being racist or sexist is pretty stupid. Vampires come in all forms, and some of them are going to be a lot more powerful than you are so pissing them off won't get you far. It's hard to be a mysoginist when you're dealing with female vampires that are hundreds or thousands of years older than you and could snap your body or mind in half like a twig. Whatever beliefs about mortals might be, for the most part vampires will accept that the blood of Caine makes everyone equel. So to some degree this is just a matter of natural selection. Vampires who are virulently racist or sexist probably won't last for more than a couple of decades because they'll piss someone off that's stronger than them. But there may be some vampires that are openly racist or sexist (look no further than Mithras) and those vampires are likely to be very old and very powerful. <br /> <br /> But it's also important that while racism and sexism do exist, to some degree, within vampire society, the gameline should not be <i>encouraging</i> players to play racists or sexists. This was a big problem with Werewolf, where you'd have literal neo-Nazi's show up to LARPs as members of the Swords of Heimdall, spew all sorts of racist bullshit and then say, &quot;Well I'm just playing in character and the game says that's okay.&quot; Even if players want to play those sorts of characters, the gameline shouldn't be putting those examples and concepts out in front and saying, &quot;This is the sort of character we want you playing as.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-02T21:38:02-07:00","id":1521943,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Asmodai</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1520736-what-do-you-think-they-are-going-to-do-for-v6?p=1521929#post1521929\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You have more faith in Vampires than I would..</div> </div> </div> </div>When it comes to matters of greed and ambition? Yes I have a lot of &quot;faith&quot; in the kindred. The reason the Camarilla Inner Circle doesn't bother with such matters (even through their various agents) is because they have no interest in micromanaging a global conspiracy of vampires. There are always other powerful vampires in a city that will take advantage of even a Prince that opts for displays of weakness to exploit. The overlap of the requite amount of bigotry to actually expel all vampires that were members of a given faith as humans, and the skills and patience necessary to build up a court that will side with the decision and oppose any attempt for a new Prince to take over would be rather rare.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-03T00:29:39-07:00","id":1521956,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1520736-what-do-you-think-they-are-going-to-do-for-v6?p=1521921#post1521921\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> The problem people had, was that they hired a Mexican author to write a bunch of cool Mexican content, and then put that in a section where white American Hunters would have to hunt Mexicans.<br /> <br /> The section on the Philippines was much better received because they let the Filipino author work on the whole of it, including the hunters, and present a much better cultural expression by letting it be holistic and thus avoid that sort of issue.</div> </div> </div> </div>Unfortunately, this is neither the problem with the book, nor the problem with the discussions about the book.<br /> <br /> The two sections are in the same Chapter, Antagonists, at page 170 and 175. Nowhere in Ephraim's writeup &quot;white American Hunters&quot; are ever mentioned. And nowhere was the fact that the author was Mexican underlined (I was the one posting the info here, and I received no reply, I don't remember if someone brought it up on RPG.net ).<br /> <br /> All the comments here were based on the idea that a Mexican antagonist working as a drug and human smuggler was probably the work a crude white American lacking sensitivity consultancy.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12590,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12590-manfr","user":"Manfr","date":". 09-03-2023, 03:42 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12590-manfr","name":"Manfr","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"449"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-03T00:40:27-07:00","id":1521957,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1520736-what-do-you-think-they-are-going-to-do-for-v6?p=1521921#post1521921\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> And? Old material having things that in retrospect were bad doesn't excuse continuing to do it. Should we go back to when the only Arabic coded Clan was a bunch of sociopath murderers because what else would vampires from the Middle East be good at? Or can we acknowledge that was bad, and move on (even if yes, some Middle Eastern vampires are going to be assassins as that job exists across the globe).<br /> <br /> [...]<br /> <br /> And... this is still a deflection from it being a horrible idea for the one of the first V5 previews people got was that kind of scenario. One of the reasons why the rumor mill is so bad, is because nWW/Paradox have no sense about how to handle these topics with a wide audience.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>The very same edition that gave justice to the Arabic and Traveller-coded Clans gave us Confederate Brujah. V20 also maintained the very same line about Nazi Skinhead Brujah, if I'm not mistaken.<br /> <br /> My impression is that a segment of the community was trying to justify its extreme rejection of &quot;new hands&quot; leading the franchise, by framing it into some sort of antifascist resistance, to deflect criticism about gatekeeping.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1520736-what-do-you-think-they-are-going-to-do-for-v6?p=1521921#post1521921\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Because this is a fictional construct and how the designer and writers frame it impacts its function.<br /> <br /> Though consider: vampire society is dominated by vampires that preexist our modern concept of race. Vampire society as presented scoffs at human sexism because, again, the Elders have plenty of women, and they know that sexism is just a way to anger and underestimate vampires just as capable as those that think physical features matter. Why would a vampire that saw the rise and fall of the Roman Empire (including Emperors of multiple ethnic backgrounds) tolerate some ancillae's mindless ramblings about how black vampires can't possibly be trusted with important positions like Primogen instead of seeing any vampire as the potential threat and asset that they are on the inside?<br /> <br /> How many cultures have Elders and Methuselahs seen rise and fall, all claim the same stupid human prejudices? &quot;We Greeks are clearly the best people, everyone else is a barbarian,&quot; unless Alexander's empire falls apart as his generals can never consolidate power and former barbarian-turned-civilization Romans take over? Then Romans do the same thing. And so, and so on. Human bigotry is a weakness for vampires to use to manipulate humans, not one that serves them in the slightest to hold on to.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I'd say that your considerations are probably more appropriate for the dynamic Elders of Requiem, but to a point they are still valid in VtM, perhaps not universally among Clans (we are told, for instance, that academic sexism was well alive in the higher ranks of Clan Tremere).<br /> <br /> Still, I'd say the difference between Elders and Neonates here it's very relevant. Neonates (which are the default characters you are going to play in V1, V2, Revised and V5) are brought into unlife full of their prejudices and life experiences, and may easily revel in their newfound powers. Lots of character concepts are based around these ideas.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12590-manfr","name":"Manfr","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"449"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-03T04:37:20-07:00","id":1521973,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1520736-what-do-you-think-they-are-going-to-do-for-v6?p=1521938#post1521938\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">At the same time for the most part, older vampires have realized that being racist or sexist is pretty stupid. Vampires come in all forms, and some of them are going to be a lot more powerful than you are so pissing them off won't get you far. It's hard to be a mysoginist when you're dealing with female vampires that are hundreds or thousands of years older than you and could snap your body or mind in half like a twig. Whatever beliefs about mortals might be, for the most part vampires will accept that the blood of Caine makes everyone equel. So to some degree this is just a matter of natural selection. Vampires who are virulently racist or sexist probably won't last for more than a couple of decades because they'll piss someone off that's stronger than them. But there may be some vampires that are openly racist or sexist (look no further than Mithras) and those vampires are likely to be very old and very powerful.</div> </div> </div> </div>My general view here is that you are not going to be openly an asshole to someone who you are afraid of. Usually people who enjoy lording such elements over others they perceive as lesser do it from a position of power and will not seek direct conflict with things they are fucktards about. If you are a person in position of power you will abuse it against those who are your lessers. And they might exploit your weak spots if they are competant.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1520736-what-do-you-think-they-are-going-to-do-for-v6?p=1521938#post1521938\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But it's also important that while racism and sexism do exist, to some degree, within vampire society, the gameline should not be <i>encouraging</i> players to play racists or sexists. This was a big problem with Werewolf, where you'd have literal neo-Nazi's show up to LARPs as members of the Swords of Heimdall, spew all sorts of racist bullshit and then say, &quot;Well I'm just playing in character and the game says that's okay.&quot; Even if players want to play those sorts of characters, the gameline shouldn't be putting those examples and concepts out in front and saying, &quot;This is the sort of character we want you playing as.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Absolutley.<br /> <br /> \u200b","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":1182,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","user":"Asmodai","date":". 09-03-2023, 09:55 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-03T04:40:27-07:00","id":1521974,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Manfr</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1520736-what-do-you-think-they-are-going-to-do-for-v6?p=1521956#post1521956\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Unfortunately, this is neither the problem with the book, nor the problem with the discussions about the book.<br /> <br /> The two sections are in the same Chapter, Antagonists, at page 170 and 175. Nowhere in Ephraim's writeup &quot;white American Hunters&quot; are ever mentioned. And nowhere was the fact that the author was Mexican underlined (I was the one posting the info here, and I received no reply, I don't remember if someone brought it up on RPG.net ).<br /> <br /> All the comments here were based on the idea that a Mexican antagonist working as a drug and human smuggler was probably the work a crude white American lacking sensitivity consultancy.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's still a problem because it's out of context. The book assumes this border adjacent setting and presents all the baddies as Mexican originated. The text itself is not the problem it's the context within the game as presented. You handle such things by making the sample party and sample character in character creation people from Mexico and give them a Drive adjacent to one of these baddies. There you have context and immediately demonstrate that the default assumption isn't heroic white people defending the borders from evil aliens.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-03T06:53:30-07:00","id":1521977,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Manfr</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1520736-what-do-you-think-they-are-going-to-do-for-v6?p=1521957#post1521957\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The very same edition that gave justice to the Arabic and Traveller-coded Clans gave us Confederate Brujah. V20 also maintained the very same line about Nazi Skinhead Brujah, if I'm not mistaken.</div> </div> </div> </div>A quick check on the V20 pdf doesn't turn up anything that directly mentions nazi skinhead Brujah. The only possible in they would have is in the &quot;embrace someone of the opposite beliefs&quot; passage, which is explicitly done as a punishment.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> My impression is that a segment of the community was trying to justify its extreme rejection of &quot;new hands&quot; leading the franchise, by framing it into some sort of antifascist resistance, to deflect criticism about gatekeeping. </div> </div> </div>Or it could be that the &quot;new hands&quot; are actively courting an old way of doing things that doesn't really help the games go in new places. And so it is - the cores are all chock full of one true wayism, making them the gatekeepers of a new era because they mandate &quot;street level&quot; play and focus and offer nothing else. It's just... gone, fwwp, cut off completely.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I'd say that your considerations are probably more appropriate for the dynamic Elders of Requiem, but to a point they are still valid in VtM, perhaps not universally among Clans (we are told, for instance, that academic sexism was well alive in the higher ranks of Clan Tremere).<br /> <br /> Still, I'd say the difference between Elders and Neonates here it's very relevant. Neonates (which are the default characters you are going to play in V1, V2, Revised and V5) are brought into unlife full of their prejudices and life experiences, and may easily revel in their newfound powers. Lots of character concepts are based around these ideas. </div> </div> </div>Neonates then get eaten by the system if they don't let go. Or they get sent on an innocuous &quot;errand&quot; they don't realize is a suicide mission, and go from undead to just dead. Again, not because the elders are high-minded idealists, but because they have &quot;flexible ethics&quot; and are set on a goal.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-03T09:36:35-07:00","id":1521985,"title":"","content":"Interesting fact, NIGHT ROAD was one of the most politicql thing I've read and unabashedly EVERY SINGLE PART OF IT had something to say about<b></b>:<br /> <br /> * American For-Profit Health<br /> * The War on Terror<br /> * The treatment of Mexican Migrants as horrific and evil<br /> * The Rise of the Far Right<br /> * Tech-Bro Science distracting from any actual valid help of humanity<br /> * The failed US Economy<br /> * Religious Extremism<br /> <br /> And it was FANTASTIC.<br /> <br /> The problem being that it was literally an online Choose-Your-Own Adventure book and the writers of it (probably the best other than OPP) weren't the kind of people writing the actual supplements to the game.<br /> <br /> It actually had a very good way of writing its strong political stances too.<br /> <br /> The TLDR version?<br /> <br /> &quot;Vampires are awful. They are predatory parasites that innately hurt human beings and make their lives worse. They often insert themselves into power structures of humanity that prey on others and make THOSE worse. However, humanity is actually just as awful and the worst things that vampires do are set up by humans to do against fellow humans.&quot;\u200b","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-03T11:11:34-07:00","id":1521990,"title":"","content":"I have faith that most older ancilla and elders are pragmatic enough to look at the bigger picture and work with others that they might have issues in the past to keep themselves safe. In regards to ancients I seem to recall that in some sources that somewhere between their 1,000-2,000 year that they undergo a profound change in there outlooks and find most mortal issues very trivial as they have seen empires rise and fall countless times and can\u2019t muster enough interest to care about what drives the younger members.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-03T12:35:00-07:00","id":1521998,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1520736-what-do-you-think-they-are-going-to-do-for-v6?p=1521990#post1521990\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have faith that most older ancilla and elders are pragmatic enough to look at the bigger picture and work with others that they might have issues in the past to keep themselves safe. In regards to ancients I seem to recall that in some sources that somewhere between their 1,000-2,000 year that they undergo a profound change in there outlooks and find most mortal issues very trivial as they have seen empires rise and fall countless times and can\u2019t muster enough interest to care about what drives the younger members.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think the &quot;official&quot; stance is that by the time you're a century old, you view humans as food and ALL as lesser beings.<br /> <br /> So, Lodin and Balthazar from CBN still hating black people is something of a weird quirk both possess.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=